.TH CHIMERA-BINARY-HEADERS 1
.SH NAME
chm-binary-headers \- identify executable formats and architecture headers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 tools/inspect-binary-headers.py
.RI [ --json ]
.I FILE ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads file headers without executing the input. Identifies ELF, PE/COFF, DOS MZ, Mach-O, universal Mach-O, WebAssembly, and Java class files. Reports the operating-system family, CPU architecture, bitness, and byte order when present.
.PP
This is a header recognizer, not a compatibility loader, malware scanner, signature verifier, or proof that a binary can run on the current kernel.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when all files were read; 1 when any file could not be read.
